<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,maximum-scale=1,user-scalable=no,viewport-fit=cover"><title>Pixel Survival V1.3.3</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css?v=133"></head><body><canvas id="game"></canvas><div id="menu"><h1>PIXEL SURVIVAL <small>V1.3.3</small></h1><p>3D 联机生存 · 手机 / 平板 / 电脑</p><input id="name" maxlength="18" placeholder="玩家昵称" value="Player"><input type="hidden" id="mode" value="squad"><div id="modeButtons" role="group" aria-label="游戏模式"><button type="button" data-mode="squad" aria-pressed="true">40 人模式</button><button type="button" data-mode="duel" aria-pressed="false">1v1 单挑</button><button type="button" data-mode="zombie" aria-pressed="false">尸潮模式</button></div><select id="difficulty" aria-label="四人模式难度"><option value="easy">简单（原版 AI）</option><option value="normal">普通（中等 AI）</option><option value="hard">困难（精准且主动）</option></select><div class="row"><button id="create">创建房间</button><input id="code" inputmode="numeric" maxlength="6" placeholder="六位房间号"><button id="join">加入</button></div><p id="roomtext">等待创建或加入房间</p><button id="start" hidden>开始游戏（房主）</button><button id="enableAudio">开启声音 / 重试</button><span id="audioStatus">点击开启声音</span><details><summary>音量设置</summary><label>音乐 <input id="musicVolume" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="45"></label><label>音效 <input id="effectsVolume" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="65"></label></details><button id="perfLobby" type="button">画质与性能</button><p id="error"></p></div><section id="characterSelect" hidden><h2>选择角色</h2><div id="characterCards"></div><div id="characterDetails">点击角色查看技能和被动简介。</div><p id="readyList"></p><button id="characterReady" disabled>准备</button><p>七个角色技能均由服务器同步。烈焰与盾支持触屏瞄准。</p></section><div id="hud" hidden><div id="killNotice" hidden style="position:fixed;top:25%;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:#142a32dd;color:white;padding:10px 18px;border-radius:8px;pointer-events:none;z-index:30"></div><span id="fpsCounter" style="position:fixed;top:48px;right:12px;color:white;background:#0008;padding:4px 8px;border-radius:5px;pointer-events:none">-- FPS</span><div id="top"><button id="mapBtn">地图</button><span id="stats">加载中…</span><button id="bagBtn">背包</button><button id="perfGame" type="button">画质</button></div><div id="waveInfo" hidden style="font-weight:bold;color:#ffcf83;background:#222a;padding:6px;border-radius:6px"></div><div id="team"></div><div id="downedStatus" hidden></div><div id="spectator" hidden><button id="spectatorPrev" aria-label="上一位队友">‹</button><span id="spectatorName"></span><button id="spectatorNext" aria-label="下一位队友">›</button></div><div id="weapons"></div><div id="loot"></div><div id="actions"><button id="reload">换弹</button><button id="heal">药包</button><button id="revive" hidden>救援</button><button id="cancelRevive" hidden>取消救援</button><button id="edit">调键位</button></div><button id="skill" type="button" aria-label="技能"><span id="skillName">技能</span><strong id="skillTime">就绪</strong></button><button id="cancelSkill" type="button" hidden aria-label="取消技能">✕<small>取消施法</small></button><div id="skillHint" hidden><span id="skillHintText"></span></div><div id="move" class="stick"><div class="nub"></div><span>移动</span></div><div id="aim" class="stick"><div class="nub"></div><span>瞄准/射击</span></div></div><div id="bag" class="panel" hidden><div class="panelHead"><h2>背包</h2><button class="panelX" id="bagX" aria-label="关闭背包">✕</button></div><div id="bagItems"></div><button id="closeBag">关闭</button></div><div id="mapPanel" class="panel" hidden><div class="panelHead"><h2>大地图 · 毒圈</h2><button class="panelX" id="mapX" aria-label="关闭地图">✕</button></div><small id="mapLegend">蓝点：队友 · 区域名称已标注 · 空投图标会显示在地图上</small><canvas id="mapCanvas" width="500" height="500"></canvas><button id="closeMap">关闭</button></div><div id="eliminated" class="panel" hidden style="z-index:120;text-align:center"><h2>队伍已全部淘汰</h2><p>本局游戏结束，可以返回大厅创建新房间。</p><button id="returnLobby" style="font-size:20px;padding:14px 28px">退出到大厅</button></div><div id="banner" hidden></div><div id="actionProgress" hidden><div id="progressCircle"><span id="progressLabel"></span><strong id="progressSeconds"></strong></div></div><section id="perfPanel" class="panel" hidden aria-label="画质与性能设置"><div class="panelHead"><h2>画质与性能</h2><button id="perfClose" class="panelX" aria-label="关闭画质设置">✕</button></div><label>目标帧率 <select id="perf-fps"><option value="30">30 FPS</option><option value="60">60 FPS</option><option value="90">90 FPS</option><option value="120">120 FPS</option><option value="0">不限（受设备限制）</option></select></label><label>画质 <select id="perf-quality"><option value="low">流畅</option><option value="medium">均衡</option><option value="high">高清</option><option value="ultra">极致</option></select></label><label>渲染分辨率 <output id="perf-resolution-value">80%</output><input id="perf-resolution" type="range" min="50" max="100" step="5" value="80"></label><label><input type="checkbox" id="perf-dynamic" checked> 自动动态分辨率</label><label><input type="checkbox" id="perf-effects" checked> 精简特效</label><label><input type="checkbox" id="perf-lod" checked> 远距离模型简化</label><p id="perf-actual">实际分辨率比例 80%</p><small>只影响本机画面，不改变服务器规则。帧率受屏幕刷新率与浏览器限制。</small><button id="perfReset" type="button">恢复默认设置</button></section><script type="module" src="/game.js?v=133"></script></body></html>
